## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design privacy-preserving, device-local risk mechanisms for payments, balancing user friction, accuracy, and regulatory constraints.

## Key Concepts

- On-device ML, secure enclave, latency budgeting
- Signal engineering for behavioral biometrics
- Regulatory/compliance (PCI, PSD2), consent and privacy
- Telemetry design (local only)
- Privacy risk management, false positives, rollback

